    description: "**Defect.** The spec's profile example documents a `repo_kind` field that no code produces and no map emits.\n\n**Evidence.** docs/hypergumbo-spec.md's profile example (line ~769) shows a repo_kind field with example value \"web_api\", but the field appears in no producer source (grep repo_kind packages/*/src/ = 0 hits) and in no emitted map — a phantom documented in the spec example only.\n\n**Contract.** Fields shown in the spec's profile example should correspond to fields the producer actually emits.\n\n**Consequence.** A consumer reading the spec example to learn the profile shape codes against a repo_kind field that never appears and gets a missing-field result."  # 5613
    fields: {}  # 5613
