  message: "DONE — spec-only. The profile example documented a repo_kind field.\n\nVerified absent two ways before removing: a fresh self-survey's profile carries exactly {dev_frameworks, framework_evidence, framework_mode, frameworks, languages} and no repo_kind, and a tree-wide grep finds the token nowhere outside that one example. So it is a phantom in the documentation rather than an unimplemented feature with a producer waiting on it, and it is removed rather than implemented.\n\nSame class as WI-sizis (profile.total_files/total_lines declared and never emitted), arriving from the prose side instead of the schema side — both closed in this session's contract-accuracy sweep."  # 56ba
